Request ID: SR-2026-0713-09\nStatus: Approved for publication | Owner: Mika Tan | Implementation due: 2026-07-15 16:00 JST\n\nHi Erin and Jonah,\n\nConfirmed: MTR-09 is net recognized GMV. For FY26 Q3 as of 2026-07-13, completed gross merchandise value of ¥86.0M less refunds posted through the cutoff of ¥1.8M equals net GMV of ¥84.2M.\n\nThe card will read “Net GMV (MTR-09).” Its hover note will state the gross/refund bridge. I reconciled Online ¥46.3M plus Stores ¥37.9M, and the regional and category totals, to the same ¥84.2M. Cancelled/uncompleted orders, taxes, shipping, gift-card load, and post-cutoff refunds are excluded.\n\nErin approved this reporting treatment and Jonah concurred. I will update the dashboard definition panel and attach closeout evidence to the register by the implementation due time.\n\nMika\n
